00:37:13,125 --> 00:37:15,325
初めは食べてない！
We didn't eat it at first!

555
00:37:15,325 --> 00:37:19,625
ちゃちゃもにゃ！
No excuses!

556
00:37:19,625 --> 00:37:21,625
こぼじゃないんだよ！ 何をしてるのー？
It wasn't me! What are you doing?

557
00:37:22,125 --> 00:37:24,625
Oh, calm down! Today is your birthday!

558
00:37:24,625 --> 00:37:27,625
え、ちょ... 誕生日！ Happy birthday!
Eh, wait... Birthday! Happy birthday!

559
00:37:28,625 --> 00:37:31,125
あーっ！ あ、ありがとー！
Ah! Thank you!

560
00:37:31,125 --> 00:37:35,925
