Happy birthday! Welcome, welcome! Today is a celebration!

561
00:37:36,625 --> 00:37:41,925
えー、じゃあ、先輩達と一緒に歌って踊りたい！
Umm, then I want to sing and dance together with my senpais!

562
00:37:42,125 --> 00:37:44,125
歌って踊りたい！
Sing and dance!

563
00:37:44,625 --> 00:37:46,125
