So, did you practice? Of course!

570
00:38:09,325 --> 00:38:12,925
あ、バッチリ！ こぼ先輩、これ振り付け？
Ah, perfect! Kobo-senpai, is this choreography?

571
00:38:13,125 --> 00:38:16,625
いや、これ choreography!
No, this is choreography!

572
00:38:16,625 --> 00:38:18,925
じゃあ、行きましょう！
Then let's listen!

573
00:38:19,125 --> 00:38:21,625
イエス！ 行きましょう！ OK! Let's go!
Yes! Let's go! OK! Let's go!

574
00:38:22,125 --> 00:38:24,925
おー、いいね！ ポジションOK？
Oh, nice! Position OK?

575
00:38:25,125 --> 00:38:27,625
OK! ポジションOK！
OK! Position OK!

576
00:38:27,625 --> 00:38:29,925
OK, OK, じゃあ行きましょう！
OK, OK, then let's go!

