throwaway and oversway その名前は honey mead
throwaway and oversway, its name is honey mead.

584
00:39:53,125 --> 00:40:00,925
蜜月 un ・ deux ・ trois 互いの指を絡めて
Honeymoon un, deux, trois, interlocking our fingers,

585
00:40:01,532 --> 00:40:04,632
Singin' swingin' sweetest song

586
