Singin' swingin' sweetest song

606
00:41:54,032 --> 00:41:58,532
二人の愛を奏でる
Playing our love.

607
00:42:44,032 --> 00:42:46,332
楽しかったー！
That was so fun!

608
00:42:46,332 --> 00:42:48,532
やったー！
Yay!

609
00:42:48,732 --> 00:42:51,332
ダンス上手！ダンス上手！
Great dancing! So good at dancing!

610
