640
00:45:10,579 --> 00:45:14,879
当たり前さえも奇跡 触れ合えない君との軌跡
Even the ordinary was a miracle; the path shared with you, whom I cannot touch.

641
00:45:15,079 --> 00:45:20,079
どれだけ恋しても 超えられない君を
No matter how much I fall in love, I cannot reach beyond you...

642
