Take me free

651
00:45:57,079 --> 00:46:02,879
ほど解きたいほど 愛しているのよ
I love you so much that I want to unravel it all.

652
00:46:03,079 --> 00:46:07,579
気づけばあなたのことばかり浮かべて
Before I know it, my mind is filled only with thoughts of you.

653
00:46:07,879 --> 00:46:12,579
明日になれば大丈夫
If tomorrow comes, I'll be alright.

654
00:46:12,579 --> 00:46:18,079
何度と言い聞かせればいいの
How many times must I keep convincing myself?

655
00:46:18,579 --> 00:46:24,579
愛という沼に 溺れている
I'm drowning in the swamp called love.

656
00:46:24,879 --> 00:46:29,579
私の声は 届かない
My voice doesn't reach you.

657
00:46:29,879 --> 00:46:35,079
サヨナラの前に キスをして
Kiss me before we say goodbye,

