pay attention to me.

697
00:50:23,431 --> 00:50:30,931
またあの季節 この空の下 見上げている
Once again in that season, under this sky, I'm looking up.

698
00:50:32,731 --> 00:50:43,131
傷ついたもの もう元には 戻らないけど
What was hurt will never go back to the way it was, but...

699
00:50:44,031 --> 00:50:53,431
離したくない 離れたくない もう諦めない
I don't want to let go, I don't want to be apart, I won't give up anymore.

700
00:50:53,931 --> 00:51:02,031
あなたの心 傷つけてでも この気持ち
Even if it hurts your heart, this feeling...

701
00:51:02,131 --> 00:51:12,931
嘘つけない いつか笑顔で 話せるような
I cannot lie. So that one day we can talk with a smile,

702
00:51:13,031 --> 00:51:19,331
私を見つけて
please find me.

703
00:51:19,431 --> 00:51:25,431
傍に居て 聞かせてほしい
Stay by my side, I want you to tell me...

704
00:51:25,531 --> 00:51:32,431
二度と一人にはしないと
that you'll never leave me alone again.

705
00:51:46,731 --> 00:51:51,731
変えられない日々 抱きしめたまま
Embracing the unchangeable days,

706
00:51:51,831 --> 00:51:56,731
きっとそう きっと
surely, yes, surely...

707
00:51:56,831 --> 00:52:05,931
あの日の気持ち 受け止めないと 前に進むことができない
If I don't accept the feelings of that day, I can't move forward.

708
00:52:06,131 --> 00:52:10,731
離したくない 離れたくない
I don't want to let go, I don't want to be apart.

709
00:52:10,831 --> 00:52:15,531
一つになれない
Even if we can't become one,

710
00:52:15,631 --> 00:52:21,231
大好きだよと 伝えたいだけ
I just want to tell you that I love you.

711
00:52:21,331 --> 00:52:25,931
ホント 素直じゃないけれど
Honestly, I'm not very honest, but...

712
00:53:34,731 --> 00:53:39,931
So, how is it, guys?

713
00:53:40,431 --> 00:53:47,931
The last closing... Did you take a lot of screenshots?

714
00:53:48,131 --> 00:53:51,931
And ah, how about my new stage?

715
00:53:52,031 --> 00:53:57,731
Look! Wow, it's very cloudy here.

716
00:53:58,131 --> 00:54:07,431
Yeah, as you can see, there's two big Chillus on the left and right.

717
00:54:07,531 --> 00:54:11,931
So cute! みんなどうだった？こぼのパフォーマンス。
So cute! How was everyone? Kobo's performance.

718
00:54:12,131 --> 00:54:15,731
いっぱいスクショ取れたかな？
Did you get to take lots of screenshots?

719
00:54:15,831 --> 00:54:23,931
こぼの新しいステージはもうどうだった？可愛いでしょ？ビッグチルズがありますのでめちゃ可愛いよね！
How was Kobo's new stage? Cute, right? Having the Big Chillus makes it super cute, doesn't it?

720
00:54:26,431 --> 00:54:32,431
So actually, yeah, we're already at the end of the show, guys.

721
00:54:32,931 --> 00:54:38,131
そろそろお別れ時間になりますよ。
It's almost time to say goodbye.

722
00:54:38,231 --> 00:54:42,931
But don't worry! Kobo still has something to share with you guys.

723
00:54:43,131 --> 00:54:46,931
まだ皆さんにお知らせがあります！
I still have an announcement for everyone!

724
00:54:48,131 --> 00:54:50,731
