Tada!

725
00:54:51,131 --> 00:55:00,431
Kobo Kanaeru Special Birthday 2025 Merch Set!

726
00:55:00,731 --> 00:55:04,631
This time, Kobo's birthday merch theme is Jellyfish...

727
00:55:04,611 --> 00:55:05,811
Princess...

728
00:55:06,411 --> 00:55:10,511
I wanted to wear a jellyfish costume for a long time,

729
00:55:10,511 --> 00:55:13,711
and finally, my wish came true.

730
00:55:13,711 --> 00:55:15,511
