731
00:55:15,511 --> 00:55:17,311
Do I look beautiful?

732
00:55:17,311 --> 00:55:21,411
And the KV is drawn by Sukotti-sensei.

733
00:55:21,411 --> 00:55:25,611
Sukotti-sensei, ありがとう！ありがとう！
Sukotti-sensei, thank you! Thank you!

734
00:55:25,611 --> 00:55:28,611
And, as you wish, guys...

735
00:55:29,411 --> 00:55:31,811
Finally, ta-da!

736
00:55:31,811 --> 00:55:35,511
Kobokers' Happi is here!

737
00:55:35,511 --> 00:55:41,111
Now you guys can be proud Kobokers and perfect for cheering me during events.
Now you guys can be proud Kobokers, perfect for cheering me during events.

738
00:55:42,811 --> 00:55:48,311
Keren banget! Happi, happi, happi! Come on, buy happi, happi!
It's so cool! Happi, happi, happi! Come on, buy happi, happi!

739
00:55:48,311 --> 00:55:54,711
And if you look closely, this happi design is like... it's like my raincoat, right?

